[32m+[m[32m// shared clock rather than the last number the worker reported, so a revised[m
[32m+[m[32m// percentage walks to its new place over `MOTION.settle` instead of appearing[m
[32m+[m[32m// there. Six distinct glyph states between two values 25% apart is the[m
[32m+[m[32m// contract: it is what the whole-cell bar could not do, and it is what makes[m
[32m+[m[32m// the motion something a reader sees rather than infers.[m
